, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Go to the website and log in. Swipe right if you find someone interesting, or swipe left if you're not interested! If you like a profile, you can also bookmark it in your list of favorites.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        This is much easier than picking someone up at a bar.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Maybe ... You should still work on your pick up lines, though!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le11ob02re2img01.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le11ob02re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}], "id": 0}]}